<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<addon
  id="visualization.zunradio"
  version="22.0.0"
  name="ZUN rádio scéna"
  provider-name="Underground Media Management s.r.o.">
  <requires>@ADDON_DEPENDS@</requires>
  <extension
    point="xbmc.player.musicviz"
    library_@PLATFORM@="@LIBRARY_FILENAME@"/>
  <extension point="xbmc.addon.metadata">
    <platform>@PLATFORM@</platform>
    <license>GPL-2.0-or-later</license>
    <website>https://zunradio.cz/</website>
    <source>https://github.com/undergroundmm/visualization.zunradio</source>
    <email>info@undergroundmediamanagement.cz</email>
    <summary lang="en_GB">Red dots and rings moving to the beat, as on zunradio.cz</summary>
    <summary lang="cs_CZ">Červené tečky a kruhy v rytmu hudby jako na zunradio.cz</summary>
    <description lang="en_GB">The full screen scene of ZUN radio: red dots, rings and waves on black that react to the bass and the highs of the music. It works with any music. In the scene of the ZUN radio add-on it also draws the red card around the cover of the track on air, pulsing with the bass. Choose it in Settings > Player > Music > Visualisation.</description>
    <description lang="cs_CZ">Scéna ZUN rádia přes celou obrazovku: červené tečky, kruhy a vlny na černé, které reagují na basy a výšky hudby. Funguje s jakoukoli hudbou. Ve scéně doplňku ZUN rádio navíc kreslí červenou kartu kolem obalu právě hrající skladby, která pulzuje s basy. Vyberte ji v Nastavení > Přehrávač > Hudba > Vizualizace.</description>
    <disclaimer lang="en_GB">The ZUN radio name and logo belong to the operator of the station, Underground Media Management s.r.o.</disclaimer>
    <disclaimer lang="cs_CZ">Název a logo ZUN rádia patří provozovateli stanice, Underground Media Management s.r.o.</disclaimer>
    <news>22.0.0 (2026-11-15)
- Kodi 22 (Piers), visualisation API 5.0.0; the scene is the same as in 21.0.1
21.0.1 (2026-11-15)
- The red card is drawn only in the ZUN radio scene, no longer behind the skin menus
21.0.0 (2026-11-08)
- First version</news>
    <assets>
      <icon>resources/icon.png</icon>
      <fanart>resources/fanart.jpg</fanart>
    </assets>
  </extension>
</addon>
